  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "From the huge tunnel connecting Yellow Earth Great World and Green Lotus Great World, two armies appear, led by Qing Hao Zi and Mu Cha Lang. Mu Cha Lang shouts as Spring Upon Withered Tree. Green leaves appear all over its entire tree body, and the new leaves fly out and land on the Green Lotus Gu Immortals. Their large injuries become small, and their small injuries heal completely. Immortal killer move Green Life Taker is named. Qing Hao Zi flies with extreme speed, creating a green trail in the sky, and pierces the body of a Yellow Earth Gu Immortal. That Gu Immortal is a black bear. It grabs its empty chest, gasps, and falls to the ground. The Yellow Earth Gu Immortals are anguished. After the fatal blow, Qing Hao Zi tells them the Sacred Mountain gave orders that they will all die.",
